; Modular ERB: NEW_UPDATE/UpdateNewsletter.ERB

@Update_Newsletter(ARG)
#FUNCTIONS
;write down dates so people don't lose track of what happened at when
SELECTCASE ARG
	CASE 1
		RETURNF "Jan 23th, the year of our Lord 2024./Welcome to the new reworked and updated update menu, last implementation of this was kind of awful, a lot of things don't work and it was proven to be hard to sustain. Tried a lot of things with this one, aiming to improve the UX and sustainability./Let's hope that this iteration actually lasts more than a month being usable.//Currently treating the entire update function like a hub of character tweaks and, you guessed it, updates./So if there's any addition in the future that we don't feel like is important enough to throw at your face (e.g. the spoiler mode), major additions that we afraid you might miss out, or huge dev fuck ups, they will get announced here and you will be better informed.//We are going as overdesigned as humanly possible with this one!! 🗣️🗣️"
	CASE 2
		RETURNF "Oh and EagloV's new image sets are out. Big booba, large booba, give me a moment to port them over."
	CASE 3
		RETURNF "Achievement menu rework added, it's mostly done so that we can improve the UX, add new achievements painlessly in the future and to ease up the work of a translation fork that's based on AnonTW.//Komachi's dialogue has been translated. She's pretty sizeable, reset her to explore what she has to offer if you will./I want to update the update menu again so I don't have to announce something like this in this way..."
ENDSELECT

@Notification_Menu
PRINTL
PRINTL
PRINTFORML 개발 메일함
CUSTOMDRAWLINE -
$GoBackToStart
FOR LOCAL, News_VersionLastSeen, ATW_NEWSLETTER_VER
PRINTFORML 메시지 {LOCAL+1}은 ATW 팀으로부터 온 것이다.
CALL PRINT_LETTER(@"%Update_Newsletter(LOCAL + 1)%",,40)
WAIT
News_VersionLastSeen ++
NEXT
FOR LOCAL, NAS_News_VersionLastSeen, NAS_NEWSLETTER_VER
PRINTFORM Message {1+News_VersionLastSeen+LOCAL}은(는)부터 
CALLF PRINT_ERANAS_TITLE(0)
PRINTL  팀.
CALL PRINT_LETTER(@"%NAS_Newsletter(LOCAL + 1)%",,40)
WAIT
NAS_News_VersionLastSeen ++
NEXT
PRINTL 
PRINTFORML 메시지 끝에 도달했다.
CALL PRINTBUTTON_EX(@"[종료]",0, , , ,)
CALL PRINTBUTTON_EX(@" [메시지 지우기]",1, , , ,)
INPUT
SIF RESULT == 0
	RETURN
IF RESULT == 1
	News_VersionLastSeen = 0
	NAS_News_VersionLastSeen = 0
ENDIF

@NAS_Newsletter(ARG)
#FUNCTIONS
;write down dates so people dont lose track of what happened at when
SELECTCASE ARG
	CASE 1
		RETURNF "MONTH 9 DAY 23, the year of our Lord 2025./Did you know that eraNAS is now 3 years old? Damn. Here is another release of the game with a bunch of new toys you can play with, mainly a bunch of new stuff. This update has been in development for over a year, and I'm glad to say that it's finally in the public branch./Here is a list of new MAJOR additions that this update adds://- Youjutsu (aka Magic)! Touhous are now much more powerful in lethal combat due to them being able to use magic in combat/- Buffs and Debuffs! Combat is now no longer decided by who has the better combat stat. Even a low level can become formidable once they have buffs set up./- Resistances and Weaknesses! No more spamming the XuanMing or TaoTie (not like they exist anymore). Some touhous are now resistant to the current weapon you have and other are weak./- Youjutsu schools can be learned by either training with a trainer, using youjutsu from an enabler enough times, or by self learning after gaining the conditions needed and solving a puzzle./- Smarter Combat AI! Will heal when necessary, buff to increase armor and damage, target spells weak to their enemies, and use items in battle./- Battle Confidence! No two Touhous will perform the same in Combat, thanks to Aggression, Bravery, and Restraint./- Revamped weapon attachments! Mix and match receivers, barrels, grips, magazines, and more to build your dream weapon./- New and reworked weapons! All weapons have been replaced with a new set of weapons to remove weapon bloat. //And remember, Shinki loves you all./- Mr Pops Alot"
ENDSELECT

@PRINT_ERANAS_TITLE(ARG)
#FUNCTIONS
SELECTCASE ARG
	CASE 0
		RESETCOLOR
		PRINT 시대
		SETCOLOR 0xffc5db
		PRINT N
		SETCOLOR 0xff9999
		PRINT A
		SETCOLOR 0xfeffc3
		PRINT S
		RESETCOLOR
	CASE 1
ENDSELECT
